Short:    Aminet file sorter for IceBBS. Version 1.0
Author:   kenji_irie@geocities.com (Kenji Irie)
Uploader: kenji_irie@geocities.com
Type:     comm/bbs
Replaces: comm/bbs/IceFileSort039.lha

An Arexx script for use with the brilliant IceBBS Bulletin Board System.
Automatically sorts and moves Aminet files on joined Aminet-IceBBS files
ie: file with the readme is incorporated into the file (eg: using amijoin)

Version 1 - Second Aminet release. Bugs/Hints/Help welcome.

Cheers,

